      {
        "id": 14281,
        "title": "Operator Penugasan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126841,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena penugasan ke diri sendiri adalah alat yang ampuh untuk membangun program, mari pelajari beberapa operator yang membantu kita menulis kode dengan lebih cepat.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126842,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tahu bahwa kita bisa menambahkan <code>1</code> ke sebuah variabel dengan menuliskan nama variabel tersebut. Dalam hal ini, <code>likes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes = likes + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>likes</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "+= operator",
            "id": 126843,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daripada menulis ulang nama variabel, kita dapat menggunakan operator <code>+=</code> untuk menambahkan angka dengan <code>likes += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>likes</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+=</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "-= operator",
            "id": 126844,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mengurangi nilai variabel, kita menggunakan operator <code>-=</code>, seperti di sini ketika kita mengurangi <code>likes</code> sebanyak <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: += operator",
            "id": 126847,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: -= operator",
            "id": 126848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Operator mana yang kita gunakan untuk mengurangi angka dari nilai sebuah variabel?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 126849,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ekspresi mana yang menambahkan satu ke nilai sebuah variabel?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+= 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>-= 1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>+= 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 126850,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>199</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: += operator",
            "id": 126851,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan 10 ke nilai variabel menggunakan operator <code>+=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" yards = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yards += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(yards)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>yards</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: -= operator",
            "id": 126852,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kurangi 200 dari nilai variabel menggunakan operator <code>-=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"account -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(account)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"800\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>-=</code>, diikuti oleh <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 126853,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menambahkan nilai variabel <code>wallet</code> sebanyak satu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>wallet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+=</code>, dan terakhir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 126854,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan ekspresi decrement <code>-= 1</code> untuk mengurangi wallet sebanyak satu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>wallet -= 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
